  "title": "Saving a PeopleCode program empty deletes it and writes PSPCMPROGDEL at the new PCM; saving the key again deletes that marker",
  "statement": "When App Designer saves a PeopleCode program with all its text deleted, every PSPCMTXT, PSPCMPROG and PSPCMNAME row of its key goes and a PSPCMPROGDEL row (the seven-part key, VERSION = the new PCM, no timestamp) remains; the next save that creates a program on that key deletes the PSPCMPROGDEL row.",
  "confidence": "high",
